    "created_at": "2026-01-06T18:10:56Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-06T18:10:56Z",
    "body": "I think OP essentially wants to flatten a slot so everything that ends up being assigned to that slot is treated as a child of the slot's parent element (which is a host of a different shadow tree with its own slots). It's an interesting idea for sure.",
